You've unfortunately put yourself in an unfortunate position -- you
woke up the Wizard before you were ready to finish the game.

You need to find the Vibrating Square, which you apparently know about.
 It will be in the interior of that bottom level.  You also need the
Candelabrum of Invocation and seven candles.  The Candelabrum comes
from Vlad, who lives in a hidden tower whose entrance is some levels
upstairs from you.  You'll be looking for a maze level with two
upstairs.

Vlad is a wuss; he's no worse than the average Vampire Lord.  Make sure
the bell and book aren't cursed.  Find the vibrating square and leave
the book and bell there.  Go get the Candelabrum.  Get back to the
Vibrating Square.  Apply the candles to the candlestick (do that as
soon as you can, they won't melt if they're in the candelabrum).  Apply
the candlestick for the light.  Ring the bell.  Read the book.  It will
be quite obvious what to do from there.

Good luck.  Next time, wait until you're ready to end the game before
you wake up the wizard :-)



